OL,3,GNEWSAAldi store plan approved after
OL,4,Aappeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build an Aldi store have been
OL,7,Fapproved after an appeal.
OL,9,FThe planning application for site in
OL,10,FIvybridge, Devon, was refused in
OL,11,FNovember by members of South Hams
OL,12,FDistrict Council due to concerns over
OL,13,Fits impact on neighbouring properties.
OL,15,FIn the appeal decision, the Planning
OL,16,FInspectorate said, in the interests of
OL,17,Fpublic health and the living conditions
OL,18,Fof residents, Aldi Stores Limited would
OL,19,Fbe required to address any unexpected
OL,20,Fcontamination and to restrict delivery
OL,21,Ftimes, opening hours, noise and
OL,22,Flighting.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
